  "rationales": {"U":"需求使用模糊情态动词' may not want or need to know'，未明确用户角色、场景或上下文，导致读者无法判断该陈述是否反映真实约束或设计意图；证据片段：'A user may not want or need to know how many and which clusters a MM is managing'；此表述缺乏主语定义（'a user'指谁？终端操作员？系统管理员？审计员？）且未说明触发条件，违反可理解性基本要求","A":"'may not want or need to know'含双重否定与模态歧义——它既不禁止 disclosure，也不要求隐藏，亦未区分'want'（主观意愿）与'need'（客观必要性），导致实现者无法判定系统应主动隐藏信息、默认不展示、还是交由用户配置；证据片段同上","C":"该陈述属于对用户心理状态的推测性断言，而非可验证的事实或系统行为规范；未指明该'implication'是否构成设计约束、合规要求或UX guideline，因此正确性存疑但尚不构成明显错误；证据片段：'this has the following implications'——'this'指代不明，前文缺失，孤立看R1无法确认其参照对象","V":"无任何可观测行为、输出、状态变化或验收条件；'may not want or need to know'无法通过测试用例验证——无法设计测试来证明用户'不想要'或'不需要'；证据片段：'A user may not want or need to know how many and which clusters a MM is managing'；零可测试元素，如界面字段是否隐藏、API是否返回集群列表、日志是否记录访问等均未约定"},
  "suggestions": {"U":"Replace with atomic, role-scoped statement: 'The system shall not display the number of clusters managed by a MM, nor list those clusters, to Standard User role in the Cluster Overview dashboard'","A":"Keep the rewrite from U — it eliminates modality, specifies actor (Standard User), interface (Cluster Overview dashboard), and prohibited actions (display number, list clusters)","C":"Revise to reflect verifiable design intent: 'To reduce cognitive load for Standard Users, the Cluster Overview dashboard shall omit all cluster enumeration details for any MM'","V":"Replace with testable behavior: 'When a Standard User accesses the Cluster Overview dashboard, the UI shall render zero elements showing cluster count or cluster identifiers for any MM; this shall be verified via automated UI snapshot test and API response validation that omits clusterList and clusterCount fields'"},
